{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"izar","id":"566079740591603714","is_bot":0,"username":"izarsystem"},"author_id":"566079740591603714","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"“Because it was my job. I wasn’t treated as a human, I was treated as a commodity. A way into the Medici family. I wasn’t loved, only expected to serve as a dutiful wife and churn out babies. You’re the first person to see me as more.”","created_at":"2020-07-26T04:44:46.275000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736806195796639845","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
