{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"izar","id":"566079740591603714","is_bot":0,"username":"izarsystem"},"author_id":"566079740591603714","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"“I grew up manipulating my brother because there was no other way I could hold power. I was already supposed to be married at 13, but when my father died, there was a tiny window of freedom. Sometimes I wonder what life would be like if I didn’t grasp at that freedom and hold onto it like I had - or if that freedom had never come...”","created_at":"2020-07-26T04:49:23.606000Z","edited_at":"2020-07-26T04:50:40.601000Z","id":"736807359007162419","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
